              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Our Commitment to Your Privacy",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "At Prosper, your privacy isn’t just a legal requirement — it’s a core part of what we stand for. We don’t sell your data, we don’t exploit your content, and we design our systems with your privacy in mind. The only data we collect is what’s needed to make the app work well, improve your experience, and support the features you choose to use."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This Privacy Policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. We’ve done our best to keep it clear and respectful — because trust is essential in a space like ours."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "—"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helpful LLC (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") operates the Prosper mobile application and website (collectively, the \"Service\"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your information when you use our Service."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "By using the Service, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1"
    },
    {
